<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus to auction up to 25 mln in 91-day bills.</title>
<headline>Cyprus to auction up to 25 mln in 91-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's central bank will auction up to 25 million pounds ($49.9 million) of 91-day treasury bills with an April 9 issue date, it said on Monday.</p>
<p>Bids can be made from April 7 to 9.00 a.m local (0600 GMT) on April 9, the bank said in a statement. ($=0.501 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
